- Building a complete engineering-lifecycle framework.
- Creating a separate Alakowe repository before it has multiple independent skills or its own tooling and release lifecycle.
- Providing generic README, API, OpenAPI, changelog, glossary, or ADR templates.
- Requiring fixed domain-document filenames, ADR paths, headings, or project-knowledge schemas.
- Adding a new public skill when an existing owner can express the recurring outcome cleanly.
